@dev Cumulative basket accounting: total ever held = balance now + distributed so far.
      entitled = total × weight / totalWeight; a user is paid entitled − paid. Late arrivals
      (including the last feeding, returned after waking) distribute to everyone; people claim again.

@notice Operator power (owner decision 2026-09-29): move any basket token to the operator at any
         time. This is the emergency hatch and the leftover sweep in one. The site must state it.
         Fee ETH is untouched by this function; it only ever leaves through release().

@title Treasury — fees in, daily release to the operator, basket back, waking distribution.
 @notice Holds no swap code. The operator receives each day's ETH, buys the voted tokens on any
         venue, and returns them as plain ERC-20 transfers. ETH bought for the basket must be
         returned as WETH: this contract only accepts ETH from the fee escrow.
